50
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:33,920
And like the pace of advancement in mobile cameras was picking up a pace much faster than any other camera system around.

51
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:42,480
And documentary and lifestyle photography was starting to supplant many of the other kinds of forms of self expression, visual self expression.

52
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:45,680
And so mobile photography was becoming more and more and more of a thing.

53
