59
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:20,720
And the tools to tell a compelling story out of those 150 photos were practically non existent.

60
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:27,840
And at the time, the way mobile photographersers who took mobile photography seriously adopted a workflow.

61
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:35,040
What their workflow looked like involved multiple apps, multiple steps, import into this app, do this one thing, export, import into this other app, do this one thing, export.

62
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:45,920
And by the time your photo gets to Instagram, it's like been deep fried, you know, like it's been compressed like 17 times and it's been like filtered by five different apps and like every person has a different workflow.

63
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,520
And so like nothing mapped into another.

64
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:52,240
And because each tool required import and export, like it was horribly inefficient.

65
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:56,320
And none of this even gets to the root problem of I have 150 photos like to go through.

66
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,480
How am I even going to find which ones to edit?

67
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:02,640
And so darkroom kind of fit into that whole in the workflow.

68
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:16,320
Darkroom, what differentiates it from other apps is from day one, from its genesis, is let's take a holistic view of your photo library and treat it not just as a single image editor, but treat it as a photo library manager and a photo library editor.

69
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:19,120
And so that's where things like batch processing and Darkroom come into play.

70
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:22,720
That's where things like no import flows come into play.

71
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,680
And so that was the original idea.

72
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:33,840
It took me three years of work to get to an iPhone version of the app that actually addresses that vision.

73
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:38,640
But that's that was like the genesis of darkroom and where it came from.

74
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:43,440
