75
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:54,480
IOS 8 was in beta and IOS 8 was the first version of IOS that introduced the photo kit, which gave you access to the photo library, gave you like basically that was the framework that made darkroom possible.

76
00:06:55,280 --> 00:07:05,920
And so, you know, I within within a few weeks actually I had a version of darkroom that mirrored very closely what exists today on the iPhone finished.

77
