188
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:04,880
and you would see this pop-up that told you, here's a paywall.

189
00:15:05,040 --> 00:15:09,840
Like, you know, a lot of this for a dollar, buy this for a dollar, buy this for a dollar, buy this for four dollars.

190
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:17,600
And so our average sale price was like a dollar, you know, like we were we were asking for very little, by the way, this was February 2015.

191
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,600
There weren't a lot of subscriptions on the App Store.

192
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:25,120
Our most expensive thing was a tool was for five dollars and five dollars was expensive in 2015.

193
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,080
People really thought about that.

194
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:30,880
It was still like ambiguous whether Apple was going to bless it for general use cases, especially like utilities.

195
