197
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:41,680
Yeah.

198
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:49,760
And for our category, like, you know, the photography category itself hadn't really, like, you know, established itself as being like a worthy business model.

199
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:56,960
I mean, the one, the couple of successes were definitely VSCO and others, but like, we have to remember Lightroom wasn't fully there yet on mobile.

200
00:15:57,360 --> 00:16:00,080
Um, then Snapseed was bought by Google, so that was free.

201
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:06,000
So most of it, like, it was like a weird space to be in where you didn't have a lot of reference where it's like, oh, they clearly made it.

202
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:06,320
Yeah.

203
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:07,920
Now that's a very different game.

