00:29:57,520 --> 00:29:58,720
And so for a year we did that.

403
00:29:58,880 --> 00:30:00,800
And it was, it was quite interesting.

404
00:30:01,040 --> 00:30:04,400
because I remember Mars saying like, dude, this is not going anywhere.

405
00:30:05,040 --> 00:30:09,920
This is not going to be like, it's, it's not possible for this to make 100 grand a year.

406
00:30:10,080 --> 00:30:11,520
And then we made 100 grand a year.

